# 基本文章編集で変わった所だけを描き直す (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. After a change the
# window draws again only the paragraphs that changed or moved and the lines of the caret
# (tv_doc_band, docedit.c changed()); what that leaves on the screen must be what drawing the
# whole window again gives. In the desktop's own text editor (docproc kernel, open) and in the
# process (pdoc), each on a copy of 基本文章編集 of 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30): letters typed,
# one taken back, a new paragraph, letters typed till the lines of the paragraph break
# elsewhere, taken back till they break as before, and, wound down by the wheel, letters
# typed. After each the window is shot (band_*_N), drawn again whole (redraw) and shot again
# (band_*_N_whole), and the two compared inside the window, where the text is (101,125 to
# 682,482 of the screen: the window stands at 100,100, 600 by 400). The last of the desktop's
# and of the process's are compared too. The caret is kept from blinking (LK_BLINK 306 very
# slow) so that both shots have it alike.
# Keys: Backspace 2A, Enter 28; Ctrl+E 08 01.
docproc kernel
look 306 3600000
mkbig doc 30
open big
waitwin 基本文章編集 600
sync 600
wait 500
move 690 490
sync 600
click 300 170
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
# typed
text ab
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_1
redraw
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_1_whole
shotsame band_k_1 band_k_1_whole 101 125 682 482
# taken back
key 2A
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_2
redraw
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_2_whole
shotsame band_k_2 band_k_2_whole 101 125 682 482
# a new paragraph
key 28
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_3
redraw
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_3_whole
shotsame band_k_3 band_k_3_whole 101 125 682 482
# the lines broken elsewhere
text abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_4
redraw
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_4_whole
shotsame band_k_4 band_k_4_whole 101 125 682 482
# and back
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
key 2A
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_5
redraw
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_5_whole
shotsame band_k_5 band_k_5_whole 101 125 682 482
# wound down, then typed
move 300 300
wheel -1
sync 600
wheel -1
sync 600
wheel -1
sync 600
wait 300
click 300 300
sync 600
move 690 490
sync 600
text cd
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_6
redraw
sync 600
wait 300
shot band_k_6_whole
shotsame band_k_6 band_k_6_whole 101 125 682 482
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
# the process
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
click 300 170
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
logmark
text ab
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 800
shot band_p_1
logmark
redraw
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
shot band_p_1_whole
shotsame band_p_1 band_p_1_whole 101 125 682 482
logmark
key 2A
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 500
shot band_p_2
logmark
redraw
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
shot band_p_2_whole
shotsame band_p_2 band_p_2_whole 101 125 682 482
logmark
key 28
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 500
shot band_p_3
logmark
redraw
expectsince document: drew
wait 300
shot band_p_3_whole
shotsame band_p_3 band_p_3_whole 101 125 682 482
logmark
text abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyzabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz
expectsince document: key to screen
wait 4000
shot band_p_4
